# render.sh's output. Every PNG here is made from the HTML beside it, so the
# HTML is what is worth keeping -- a poster re-renders in two seconds.
*.png

# render-video.sh's output and its scratch frames. The MP4 is rebuilt from
# teaser-ghorband.html; the frames folder is deleted after each encode.
*.mp4
*.webm
06-video/frames/

# The store listings this folder copies for reference. Their originals are
# mobile/PlayStore and ios/AppStore, in this same repository.
04-store-listings/google-play/
04-store-listings/app-store/
